{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linkUser","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"linker","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping ","kind":"attribute"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinker","text":"SENTUserLinker","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:SENTUserLinker.h@T@SENTUserLinker"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"completionHandler","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"SENTUserLinkingResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingResult","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingResult"},{"text":"?, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SENTUserLinkingError","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingError"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")? = nil)","kind":"text"}]},{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"linkUser"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"linker"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinker","preciseIdentifier":"c:SENTUserLinker.h@T@SENTUserLinker","text":"SENTUserLinker"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingResult","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingResult","text":"SENTUserLinkingResult"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingError","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingError","text":"SENTUserLinkingError"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"name":"linker","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The linker that the SDK will pass the installation ID to."}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Links the Sentiance user to your app’s user on the Sentiance Cloud Platform."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During the linking process, the SDK will invoke the supplied SENTUserLinker, and will pass to it an installation ID."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Your app must then forward this installation ID to the Sentiance backend (via your backend), and initiate user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linking. Finally, when the linking completes, you must invoke the proper linker callback to complete the process."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the complete steps:"}]},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Call this method and supply a linker."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Your linker will be invoked during the process, and an installation ID will be supplied."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In your linker, forward the installation ID to your backend to initiate a linking request towards the Sentiance"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"backend. This request will include the installation ID and your app’s user identifier."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieve the response from the Sentiance backend and forward the result to the app."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Based on the result, invoke the linker callback’s success or failure method. The callback is supplied to  your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"linker along with the installation ID."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If it was successful, the SDK will confirm the result with the Sentiance backend to complete the link."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is useful if you want to link a Sentiance user that was created without specifying a linker in the user"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"creation options (thereby having created an unlinked user)."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With this method, a Sentiance user cannot be linked to an app user that already exists on the Sentiance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Platform (i.e. with an app user identifier that you already supplied to Sentiance during a past linking request).","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can only link to an app user that is new to Sentiance. This is because an existing app user will already have a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"corresponding Sentiance user on the platform, and that Sentiance user cannot be restored here anymore. To restore","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that user, you must reset the SDK and recreate a linked Sentiance user instead.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/Sentiance\/linkUser(linker:completionHandler:)"},"metad